window.LORE_DATA = {"meta":{"game":"wuwa","world":"Solaris-3","title":"Resonance Archive","kicker":"Wuthering Waves lore timeline","intro":"Every version since Rover first woke in Huanglong, the Resonators met on the way, and what they say about one another once you earn their trust.","current":"3.8","charWord":"Resonators"},"arcs":[{"id":"huanglong","name":"Huanglong","chapter":"Chapter I: Jinzhou Rising","range":"1.0 to 1.4","hue":"#7fe3c4","blurb":"A border city on the edge of a ruined world. Rover wakes with no memory, is drawn to Jinzhou by its young Magistrate, and learns the Lament never truly ended.","versions":[{"v":"1.0","name":"Utterance of Marvels","date":"May 22, 2024","acts":"Chapter I Acts I to VI","tags":["Jinzhou","Fractsidus"],"text":"Rover wakes with no past and is found by Yangyang and Chixia. In Jinzhou they follow a trail of tokens left by Magistrate Jinhsi, cross paths with Scar of the Fractsidus, and join General Jiyan at the front, where a Threnodian's herald is beaten back from the city.","chars":["calcharo","encore","jianxin","jiyan","lingyang","rover","verina","yinlin","aalto","baizhi","chixia","danjin","mortefi","sanhua","taoqi","yangyang","yuanwu"]},{"v":"1.1","name":"Thaw of Eons","date":"Jun 28, 2024","acts":"Chapter I Act VII","tags":["Mt. Firmament","Sentinel Jué"],"text":"On Mt. Firmament, where time itself has frozen, Rover finally meets Jinhsi. The Fractsidus try to wake a Threnodian sealed in the mountain, and Jinhsi stops it by resonating with Jué, the Sentinel of Jinzhou. Changli watches Rover from the first move.","chars":["changli","jinhsi"]},{"v":"1.2","name":"In the Turquoise Moonglow","date":"Aug 15, 2024","acts":"Companion stories","tags":["Moon-Chasing Festival"],"text":"Jinzhou holds the Moon-Chasing Festival. The painter Zhezhi and the Huaxu Academy researcher Xiangli Yao each get a story of their own.","chars":["xiangli-yao","zhezhi"]},{"v":"1.3","name":"To the Shore's End","date":"Sep 29, 2024","acts":"Chapter I Act VIII","tags":["Black Shores","Tethys System"],"text":"Rover reaches the Black Shores, a hidden organisation that has fought the Lament for ages, and learns they founded it. Its keeper is ready to burn herself out to finish their plan. Rover refuses to let the Shorekeeper pay that price.","chars":["shorekeeper","youhu"]},{"v":"1.4","name":"When the Night Knocks","date":"Nov 14, 2024","acts":"Companion story","tags":["Somnoire"],"text":"Camellya's story shows how far back her fixation on Rover goes. The Somnoire, a realm made from dreams, opens as a new challenge.","chars":["camellya","lumi"]}]},{"id":"rinascita","name":"Rinascita","chapter":"Chapter II: Even When Divinity Remains Silent","range":"2.0 to 2.8","hue":"#ffc46b","blurb":"A land of city-states, masks and carnival, ruled in faith by the Order of the Deep. Rover arrives a pilgrim and is soon named a heretic.","versions":[{"v":"2.0","name":"All Silent Souls Can Sing","date":"Jan 2, 2025","acts":"Chapter II Prologue to Act II","tags":["Ragunna","Carnevale"],"text":"Rover sails to Ragunna as its Carnevale begins. The Order of the Deep rules in the name of the Sentinel Imperator, the great families plot behind masks, and Rover is branded a heretic after learning what the Order worships in secret.","chars":["carlotta","roccia"]},{"v":"2.1","name":"Waves Sing, and the Cerulean Bird Calls","date":"Feb 13, 2025","acts":"Chapter II Act III","tags":["Riccioli Islands"],"text":"The Riccioli Islands open. Rover sails with Brant and the Troupe of Fools while the acolyte Phoebe begins to question the church that raised her.","chars":["brant","phoebe"]},{"v":"2.2","name":"Tangled Truth in Inverted Tower","date":"Mar 27, 2025","acts":"Chapter II Act IV","tags":["Avinoleum","Aero Rover"],"text":"At the academy of Avinoleum, Cantarella of the Fisalia family draws Rover into a tower turned upside down. There Rover meets Cartethyia, the Blessed Maiden the Order once raised and buried, and gains the Aero attribute.","chars":["cantarella"]},{"v":"2.3","name":"Fiery Arpeggio of Summer Reunion","date":"Apr 29, 2025","acts":"Companion stories","tags":["First anniversary"],"text":"The first anniversary. Ragunna celebrates summer with the bard Ciaccona, and Zani of the Montelli family takes on a job that will not let her clock out on time.","chars":["ciaccona","zani"]},{"v":"2.4","name":"Lightly We Toss the Crown","date":"Jun 12, 2025","acts":"Chapter II Acts V to VI","tags":["Fleurdelys","Septimont"],"text":"Cartethyia faces Fleurdelys, the knight she was made to become, and the Threnodian that has fed on Rinascita's faith. With Rover beside her she sets the crown down and chooses her own name.","chars":["cartethyia","lupa"]},{"v":"2.5","name":"Unfading Melody of Life","date":"Jul 24, 2025","acts":"Chapter II Act VII","tags":["Lost Beyond"],"text":"Rover enters the Lost Beyond of Phrolova, an Overseer of the Fractsidus, and sees the hometown she lost and the dead she has kept playing for ever since.","chars":["phrolova"]},{"v":"2.6","name":"By Sun's Scourge, By Moon's Revelation","date":"Aug 28, 2025","acts":"Chapter II Acts VIII to IX","tags":["Septimont"],"text":"In Septimont, a city of gladiators, Rover stands between Augusta, the Ephor who rules by the sun, and Iuno, the priestess who reads the moon, as an old prophecy comes due.","chars":["augusta","iuno"]},{"v":"2.7","name":"Dawn Breaks on Dark Tides","date":"Oct 9, 2025","acts":"Chapter II Acts X to XI","tags":["Dark Tide"],"text":"The Dark Tide rises over Rinascita and its story reaches a finale. The Discord hunter Galbrena and the blind swordsman Qiuyuan join the fight.","chars":["galbrena","qiuyuan"]},{"v":"2.8","name":"To the City Set in Amber","date":"Nov 20, 2025","acts":"Chapter II Act XII","tags":["Honami City","Chronorift"],"text":"Rover is pulled into Honami, a modern city sealed in a rift in time. Chisa, a student who can see the threads that hold things together, and the Taoist Buling help find a way out.","chars":["chisa","buling"]}]},{"id":"lahai-roi","name":"Lahai-Roi","chapter":"Chapter III: To the Stars Yet to Shine","range":"3.0 to 3.4","hue":"#8fc7ff","blurb":"A frozen frontier lit by an artificial sun, home to Startorch Academy and its dream of reaching the stars. Something called Voidmatter is eating it from below.","versions":[{"v":"3.0","name":"We Who See the Stars","date":"Dec 25, 2025","acts":"Chapter III Prologue to Act II","tags":["Startorch Academy","Void Storms"],"text":"Rover arrives in Lahai-Roi and enrols at Startorch Academy. The detector Hyvatia runs out of control, Void Storms worsen and a conspiracy surfaces. With Lynae and Mornye, Rover keeps the New Solar Ceremony alive so the artificial sun can rise again.","chars":["lynae","mornye"]},{"v":"3.1","name":"For You Who Walk in Snow","date":"Feb 5, 2026","acts":"Chapter III Act III","tags":["Frostlands","Exostrider"],"text":"To learn why their frequency is fading, Rover walks into the frostlands in search of the Exostrider, and finds Aemeath, once its pilot and now a digital ghost. The academy physician Luuk Herssen debuts.","chars":["aemeath","luuk-herssen"]},{"v":"3.2","name":"Resolution to Illuminate the Shadows","date":"Mar 19, 2026","acts":"Chapter III Act IV","tags":["Dark Side","Grand Architect"],"text":"As the New Solar Celebration nears, President Lucilla picks up a frequency that does not belong in the Academy's Dark Side. Rover goes in with the student Sigrika, on the trail of a gift promised by the Grand Architect of the Fractsidus.","chars":["sigrika"]},{"v":"3.3","name":"Reverbs From the End of Galaxies","date":"Apr 30, 2026","acts":"Chapter III Act V","tags":["Second anniversary","Aleph-1"],"text":"Voidmatter begins to consume Lahai-Roi. Rover descends into the Dimmr Plains again, guided by the miko Hiyuki, and faces the Threnodian Aleph-1. Afterwards Denia, a student tied to the Fractsidus, offers a deal from her infirmary bed.","chars":["denia","hiyuki"]},{"v":"3.4","name":"The Dream Not Dreamed","date":"Jun 2026","acts":"Chapter III Segue","tags":["Cyberpunk: Edgerunners"],"text":"With the Exostrider gone, funders question whether the Synchronist programme should exist, and Lucilla must choose between reality and her ideals. A Somnoire door opens in the Academy, and Lucy and Rebecca arrive from Night City in a crossover.","chars":["lucilla","lucy","rebecca"]}]},{"id":"mengzhou","name":"Mengzhou","chapter":"Chapter IV: Rebirth From the Depths","range":"3.5 to 3.8","hue":"#c9a2ff","blurb":"Back to Huanglong, and deeper. The Land of Xuanfang runs on ancient machinery, its Sentinel has gone silent, and old melodies are waking up.","versions":[{"v":"3.5","name":"Blade of Past Resounds, Lingering Dream Hymns","date":"Jul 10, 2026","acts":"Chapter IV Acts I to II","tags":["Land of Xuanfang","Autopuppets"],"text":"A package from Huanglong calls Rover to Mengzhou. The Autopuppets of Xuanfang Hold turn on its people, and Rover and the merchant Suisui trace the cause. Yangyang answers the voice that has followed her and becomes Xuanling to quell the storm.","chars":["suisui","yangyang-xuanling"]},{"v":"3.6","name":"Lamplight in Mirage, Sword's Resolve in Heart","date":"Aug 20, 2026","acts":"Chapter IV Act III","tags":["Manifold Sanctum"],"text":"Rover and the sword master Qingxiao enter the Manifold Sanctum and find the Hold's control mainframe eroded by Reverberations. The whole Hold tears loose into the sky. The Nethermancer Jingran lends a hand, by his own rules.","chars":["jingran","qingxiao"]},{"v":"3.7","name":"Prism's Illusion, Heart's Illumination","date":"Sep 30, 2026","acts":"Chapter IV Act IV","tags":["Waking Moon Festival","Simulacrum Nexus"],"text":"The Waking Moon Festival approaches under rumours that the Hold is doomed to fall. Rover searches for Hsin, the long-absent Sentinel of Mengzhou, and meets Suoming, who has governed in her name.","chars":["hsin","suoming"]},{"v":"3.8","name":"Lilies in a Dying Dream","date":"Nov 12, 2026","acts":"Chapter IV Act V","tags":["Somnoire","New Federation"],"text":"Something has changed inside the Somnoire, and the trail leads to the New Federation. Lily, a perfumer who treated soldiers through a Resonator war, wakes and has to choose again.","chars":["lily"]}]}],"chars":[{"id":"yangyang","name":"Yangyang","title":"Breath of Winds","el":"Aero","weapon":"Sword","rarity":4,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"October 11th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"An Outrider of the Midnight Rangers who hears voices on the wind. She finds Rover on the first day and never stops looking out for them.","art":true},{"id":"chixia","name":"Chixia","title":"Gallant Blaze","el":"Fusion","weapon":"Pistols","rarity":4,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"April 18th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"A Jinzhou Patroller with twin pistols and endless energy, set on becoming the kind of hero she read about as a child.","art":true},{"id":"verina","name":"Verina","title":"Nature Calling","el":"Spectro","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"May 18th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"A young botanist from the New Federation who can coax anything to grow, even in Jinzhou's scarred soil.","art":true},{"id":"rover","name":"Rover","title":"","el":"","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Unknown","faction":"The Black Shores","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"An Arbiter who wakes in Huanglong with no memory. Able to absorb any frequency, Rover turns out to have walked this world many times before, and to have founded the Black Shores.","art":true},{"id":"sanhua","name":"Sanhua","title":"Snow Waltz","el":"Glacio","weapon":"Sword","rarity":4,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"January 20th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"Bodyguard to Magistrate Jinhsi. Her left eye sees the frequencies of things, including the ones she would rather not.","art":true},{"id":"taoqi","name":"Taoqi","title":"Blossom of Slashes","el":"Havoc","weapon":"Broadblade","rarity":4,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"February 25th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"Director of Border Defense at Jinzhou's Ministry of Development. She would love a nap, and builds walls nothing gets through.","art":true},{"id":"baizhi","name":"Baizhi","title":"Healing You'tan","el":"Glacio","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":4,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"September 10th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"A quiet Huaxu Academy researcher who studies Remnant Energy with You'tan, the Remnant Creature that never leaves her side.","art":true},{"id":"encore","name":"Encore","title":"Wooly-Counting Game","el":"Fusion","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":5,"region":"Black Shores","faction":"The Black Shores","birthday":"March 21st","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"A Black Shores consultant, and a child who fights beside her woolly friends Cosmos and Cloudy.","art":true},{"id":"danjin","name":"Danjin","title":"Scarlet Shade","el":"Havoc","weapon":"Sword","rarity":4,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"August 31st","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"A young Midnight Ranger scout who hunts evil alone, with a blade that feeds on her own strength.","art":true},{"id":"aalto","name":"Aalto","title":"Mistcloak Strike","el":"Aero","weapon":"Pistols","rarity":4,"region":"Black Shores","faction":"The Black Shores","birthday":"June 11th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"An information broker of the Black Shores who can turn to mist, and sells the truth for whatever it is worth that day.","art":true},{"id":"jiyan","name":"Jiyan","title":"Windborne Rider","el":"Aero","weapon":"Broadblade","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"December 14th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"General of the Midnight Rangers, once a field medic. He leads from the front and remembers every soldier he could not save.","art":true},{"id":"mortefi","name":"Mortefi","title":"Dragon's Breath","el":"Fusion","weapon":"Pistols","rarity":4,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"November 6th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"A short-tempered Huaxu Academy researcher from the New Federation whose inventions keep Jinzhou's soldiers alive.","art":true},{"id":"camellya","name":"Camellya","title":"Sanguine Blossom","el":"Havoc","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Black Shores","faction":"The Black Shores","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"1.4","lore":"A dangerous Black Shores member who calls Rover her seed. Her obsession has outlasted lifetimes.","art":true},{"id":"calcharo","name":"Calcharo","title":"Phantom Hunter","el":"Electro","weapon":"Broadblade","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Ghost Hounds","birthday":"July 8th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"Leader of the Ghost Hounds, mercenaries from the New Federation. He takes the hard contracts and keeps his word.","art":true},{"id":"yinlin","name":"Yinlin","title":"Enforcer Puppet","el":"Electro","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"September 17th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"A dismissed Patroller turned puppeteer who still hunts corruption in Jinzhou, now without anyone's permission.","art":true},{"id":"lingyang","name":"Lingyang","title":"Frosty Gusto","el":"Glacio","weapon":"Gauntlets","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"August 8th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"A lion dancer of Jinzhou's Liondance Troupe, an outsider with a beast's ears and tail whom the troupe took in as family.","art":true},{"id":"yuanwu","name":"Yuanwu","title":"Fist of Thunder","el":"Electro","weapon":"Gauntlets","rarity":4,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"October 2nd","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"The calm owner of a boxing gym in Jinzhou, who teaches discipline before strength.","art":true},{"id":"jianxin","name":"Jianxin","title":"Cleansing Reflections","el":"Aero","weapon":"Gauntlets","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"April 6th","extra":"","ver":"1.0","lore":"A Taoist martial artist walking the world to perfect her art and take the title of the greatest fighter of her time.","art":true},{"id":"jinhsi","name":"Jinhsi","title":"Thawborn Renewal","el":"Spectro","weapon":"Broadblade","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"March 6th","extra":"","ver":"1.1","lore":"Magistrate of Jinzhou, found as a child on Mt. Firmament and chosen by the Sentinel Jué. She invited Rover to the city before they ever met.","art":true},{"id":"xiangli-yao","name":"Xiangli Yao","title":"Matter Weaver","el":"Electro","weapon":"Gauntlets","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"1.2","lore":"Chief researcher of Huaxu Academy, a gentle genius with a mechanical arm who thinks science should make people happier.","art":true},{"id":"changli","name":"Changli","title":"Eternal Blaze","el":"Fusion","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"June 6th","extra":"","ver":"1.1","lore":"Counselor to Jinhsi and once her teacher. A strategist from Mingting who plays several moves ahead and keeps her own losses to herself.","art":true},{"id":"zhezhi","name":"Zhezhi","title":"Enchanted Brush","el":"Glacio","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Jinzhou","birthday":"December 31","extra":"","ver":"1.2","lore":"A shy painter who takes commissions to get by. What she paints with enough feeling does not always stay on the paper.","art":true},{"id":"lumi","name":"Lumi","title":"Kaleido Refraction","el":"Electro","weapon":"Broadblade","rarity":4,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Lollo Logistics","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"1.4","lore":"Navigator for Lollo Logistics, small and unstoppable, who gets every parcel where it is going.","art":true},{"id":"youhu","name":"Youhu","title":"Cryogenic Wonders","el":"Glacio","weapon":"Gauntlets","rarity":4,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Chongzhou","birthday":"October 13","extra":"","ver":"1.3","lore":"An antique appraiser from Chongzhou with a sharp eye, a lucky streak and a talent for showing up where treasure is.","art":true},{"id":"shorekeeper","name":"Shorekeeper","title":"Euphonic Chrysalis","el":"Spectro","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":5,"region":"Black Shores","faction":"The Black Shores","birthday":"February 27","extra":"","ver":"1.3","lore":"Steward of the Black Shores, a being Rover once gave shape and purpose. She kept their plan running through ages of waiting.","art":true},{"id":"roccia","name":"Roccia","title":"Stage in the Box","el":"Havoc","weapon":"Gauntlets","rarity":5,"region":"Rinascita","faction":"Troupe of Fools","birthday":"January 31","extra":"","ver":"2.0","lore":"A comedian of the Troupe of Fools who came up from the sea floor and carries her whole stage in a suitcase named Pero.","art":true},{"id":"carlotta","name":"Carlotta","title":"Reshaping Dimensions","el":"Glacio","weapon":"Pistols","rarity":5,"region":"Rinascita","faction":"The Montelli Family","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.0","lore":"Second daughter of the Montelli family and its fixer, as comfortable at an art auction as she is ending a problem with a crystal gun.","art":true},{"id":"brant","name":"Brant","title":"Flamebound Compass","el":"Fusion","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Rinascita","faction":"Troupe of Fools","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.1","lore":"Captain of the Troupe of Fools, a showman and sailor who treats every rescue as an opening night.","art":true},{"id":"phoebe","name":"Phoebe","title":"Graceful Luminescence","el":"Spectro","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":5,"region":"Rinascita","faction":"Order of the Deep","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.1","lore":"An acolyte of the Order of the Deep whose faith is real. When the Order is not what she believed, she keeps the faith and leaves the lie.","art":true},{"id":"cantarella","name":"Cantarella","title":"Sea of Dreams","el":"Havoc","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":5,"region":"Rinascita","faction":"The Fisalia Family","birthday":"June 18","extra":"","ver":"2.2","lore":"Head of the Fisalia family, mistress of poisons and dreams. Nothing she offers is free, and little of it is false.","art":true},{"id":"ciaccona","name":"Ciaccona","title":"Woven Melodies","el":"Aero","weapon":"Pistols","rarity":5,"region":"Rinascita","faction":"Ragunna","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.3","lore":"A wandering bard of Ragunna who turns whatever she sees into song, and hears more than she lets on.","art":true},{"id":"zani","name":"Zani","title":"Scorched Radiance","el":"Spectro","weapon":"Gauntlets","rarity":5,"region":"Rinascita","faction":"The Montelli Family","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.3","lore":"A Montelli family employee who wants nothing more than to finish work on time, and holds the line when it counts.","art":true},{"id":"lupa","name":"Lupa","title":"Howling Flame","el":"Fusion","weapon":"Broadblade","rarity":5,"region":"Rinascita","faction":"Septimont","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.4","lore":"Septimont's champion gladiator, a wolf in the arena who fights for the glory of her city and the pack she calls family.","art":true},{"id":"phrolova","name":"Phrolova","title":"Symphony of Beyond","el":"Havoc","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":5,"region":"Fractsidus","faction":"The Fractsidus","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.5","lore":"An Overseer of the Fractsidus and a musician. She lost her home to the Lament and has kept its dead beside her since.","art":true},{"id":"cartethyia","name":"Cartethyia","title":"Feathered Tempest","el":"Aero","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Rinascita","faction":"Ragunna","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.4","lore":"The Blessed Maiden raised to become the knight Fleurdelys and then sealed away by the Order. She chose Rover, and herself, over the crown.","art":true},{"id":"augusta","name":"Augusta","title":"Magnetism Before Light","el":"Electro","weapon":"Broadblade","rarity":5,"region":"Rinascita","faction":"Septimont","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.6","lore":"Ephor of Septimont, a ruler who earned the seat in the arena and carries the city's sun on her blade.","art":true},{"id":"iuno","name":"Iuno","title":"Stasis, Cycle, Renewal","el":"Aero","weapon":"Gauntlets","rarity":5,"region":"Rinascita","faction":"Septimont","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.6","lore":"A priestess of Septimont who reads fate in the moon and decides what to do about it herself.","art":true},{"id":"buling","name":"Buling","title":"Divine Hearing","el":"Electro","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":4,"region":"Black Shores","faction":"Black Shores","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.8","lore":"A Taoist of Mengzhou, feng shui master, forum regular and Black Shores consultant who can find anything you are looking for.","art":true},{"id":"galbrena","name":"Galbrena","title":"Infernal Descent","el":"Fusion","weapon":"Pistols","rarity":5,"region":"Black Shores","faction":"The Black Shores","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.7","lore":"The Discord Slayer, feared as the Fiend of Ever-burning Flame. She now hunts across Solaris as a Black Shores consultant.","art":true},{"id":"chisa","name":"Chisa","title":"Eye of Unraveling","el":"Havoc","weapon":"Broadblade","rarity":5,"region":"Lahai-Roi","faction":"Startorch Academy","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.8","lore":"A student from Ashinohara who calls herself ordinary. Her eyes show her the threads that hold the world together, and which one to cut.","art":true},{"id":"qiuyuan","name":"Qiuyuan","title":"Bambooscape","el":"Aero","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Mingting","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"2.7","lore":"A former senior agent of Mingting's Internal Security Agency, framed for murder. He wanders as a blind swordsman, loyal to the end.","art":true},{"id":"lynae","name":"Lynae","title":"Radiant Spectrum","el":"Spectro","weapon":"Pistols","rarity":5,"region":"Lahai-Roi","faction":"Startorch Academy","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.0","lore":"A Startorch Academy prep student with a loud sense of style and a focus wound as tight as a spring.","art":true},{"id":"mornye","name":"Mornye","title":"Astral Mapping","el":"Fusion","weapon":"Broadblade","rarity":5,"region":"Lahai-Roi","faction":"Spacetrek Collective","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.0","lore":"An engineer of the Spacetrek Collective and a professor at Startorch. Her prosthetic legs carry her toward the stars she dreams about.","art":true},{"id":"luuk-herssen","name":"Luuk Herssen","title":"Phase Transition","el":"Spectro","weapon":"Gauntlets","rarity":5,"region":"Lahai-Roi","faction":"Startorch Academy","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.1","lore":"Attending physician of Startorch's Resonator Nursing Unit. He never loses his composure, and golden blood seeps from a wound that will not heal.","art":true},{"id":"aemeath","name":"Aemeath","title":"Guiding Starlance","el":"Fusion","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Lahai-Roi","faction":"Startorch Academy","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.1","lore":"Once the Exostrider's Synchronist at Rabelle College, now a digital ghost singing quietly among the stars.","art":true},{"id":"sigrika","name":"Sigrika","title":"True Name Manifestation","el":"Aero","weapon":"Gauntlets","rarity":5,"region":"Lahai-Roi","faction":"Roya Tribe","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.2","lore":"A Startorch student of the Roya Tribe who works in Royan Runes and is determined to live up to everyone's hopes.","art":true},{"id":"denia","name":"Denia","title":"Bubbles of Nihility","el":"Fusion","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":5,"region":"Lahai-Roi","faction":"Fractsidus (former)","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.3","lore":"A Department of Voidmatters student who sleeps through class and smiles at everyone. Her file lists the Fractsidus, crossed out.","art":true},{"id":"rebecca","name":"Rebecca","title":"Fury-Type Arsenal","el":"Electro","weapon":"Pistols","rarity":5,"region":"Crossover","faction":"Edgerunners","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.4","lore":"An Edgerunner from Night City, small, loud and never far from her shotgun.","art":true},{"id":"lucilla","name":"Lucilla","title":"Memory Palace","el":"Glacio","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":5,"region":"Lahai-Roi","faction":"Startorch Academy","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.4","lore":"President of Startorch Academy, an idealist with both feet on the ground, keeping watch over students who challenge the sky.","art":true},{"id":"lucy","name":"Lucy","title":"Xeno-Domain Hacking","el":"Spectro","weapon":"Pistols","rarity":5,"region":"Crossover","faction":"Edgerunners","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.4","lore":"A netrunner from Night City, part of an Edgerunner crew, who keeps even her friends at a distance.","art":true},{"id":"hiyuki","name":"Hiyuki","title":"Futures' Tithe","el":"Glacio","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Lahai-Roi","faction":"Miko of Flaming Sakura","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.3","lore":"The Miko of Flaming Sakura from Ashinohara, last member of Lahai-Roi's Special Response Force.","art":true},{"id":"yangyang-xuanling","name":"Yangyang: Xuanling","title":"Voices of Azure Plume","el":"Havoc","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Ministry of War","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.5","lore":"Yangyang as a Votary of the Voice, able to commune with the Streams. Now acting Xuan Watcher of Xuanfang Hold, she draws her sword to protect.","art":true},{"id":"suisui","name":"Suisui","title":"Host of Harmony","el":"Glacio","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Zhaoming Commerce Guild","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.5","lore":"The young director of the Zhaoming Commerce Guild, a noble of Mingting who weaves peace out of trade deals instead of swordplay.","art":true},{"id":"qingxiao","name":"Qingxiao","title":"Heart Sword","el":"Aero","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Ministry of War","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.6","lore":"The Sword Transcendent, Xuan Paragon of Xuanfang Hold in name. A recluse who has guarded these lands longer than anyone can count.","art":true},{"id":"hsin","name":"Hsin","title":"Fractal Proliferation","el":"Electro","weapon":"Rectifier","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Mengzhou City Hall","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.7","lore":"The Sentinel of Mengzhou and guide of its civilisation, fond of mortal joys and long absent from her people.","art":true},{"id":"jingran","name":"Jingran","title":"Nether Qi Art","el":"Fusion","weapon":"Broadblade","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Nethermancer","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.6","lore":"A Nethermancer of Mengzhou who walks Mirage Realms and ruins alone, and judges right and wrong by his own heart.","art":true},{"id":"suoming","name":"Suoming","title":"Power of Ten","el":"Electro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Huanglong","faction":"Ten Seals Covenant; Mengzhou - Ministry of Sentinel Affairs","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.7","lore":"Founder of the Ten Seals Covenant, formed to free her homeland from the Evil Miasma. She governs Mengzhou in the Sentinel's name.","art":true},{"id":"lily","name":"Lily","title":"Dream Weaving","el":"Spectro","weapon":"Pistols","rarity":5,"region":"New Federation","faction":"Clotho Doctors Alliance (former)","birthday":"","extra":"","ver":"3.8","lore":"A young perfumer caught in the Federated Cities' Resonator War. She could not stop it, so she healed whoever stood in front of her.","art":false}],"lines":[{"f":"yangyang","t":"jiyan","s":"","q":"On the dangerous frontiers where we suffered immense losses, it was General Jiyan who stepped up to protect everyone, making all the tough decisions to ensure our safety. …"},{"f":"yangyang","t":"chixia","s":"","q":"\"When in trouble, ask Chixia, the Ally of Justice!\" This statement, while playful, rings very true. …"},{"f":"yangyang","t":"baizhi","s":"","q":"Baizhi has a unique approach to comprehending and accomplishing tasks, but that doesn't make her a difficult person to talk to. …"},{"f":"yangyang","t":"danjin","s":"","q":"I met Danjin a few times on different occasions. I could tell how much she values justice. …"},{"f":"chixia","t":"yangyang","s":"","q":"Yangyang's such a darling, even her words sound pretty! Sometimes I can't quite get what she says though. Whatcha call those again? Ah, poems, I think!"},{"f":"chixia","t":"baizhi","s":"","q":"Speaking of Baizhi, she's not the talkative type. Don't get me wrong, she's not an Ice Queen! She just has her own ways of expressing emotions. You'll get it once you've spent enough time with her."},{"f":"chixia","t":"yinlin","s":"","q":"She was once the thunder that lit up my path ahead. I've always wanted to be like her, until I realized not everyone had that power. …"},{"f":"chixia","t":"lingyang","s":"","q":"Sometimes they'd perform liondance between hero plays. That leading dancer, Lingyang, can put on quite a show for a small guy like him! …"},{"f":"verina","t":"encore","s":"","q":"Little Encore is full of intriguing ideas, and she always has a lot of curious questions to ask. Hmm... I've got to keep looking for all the answers she wants. …"},{"f":"verina","t":"calcharo","s":"","q":"I remember meeting Mr. Calcharo when I was out collecting data in the wild. At first, he didn't seem very approachable... but then he gave me some flower seeds, all super rare species. …"},{"f":"verina","t":"yangyang","s":"","q":"Miss Yangyang was curious about my plant growing skills, and she asked me many questions earlier. Then, she patiently listened to me explaining details for a long, long time. …"},{"f":"verina","t":"chixia","s":"","q":"Miss Chixia once fed me a spoonful of her Victor Savor... I-I couldn't believe how spicy it was! What kind of pepper was that? Ow, my mouth still burns just thinking about it."},{"f":"sanhua","t":"jinhsi","s":"","q":"Lately, my lady prefers to wake up earlier, so I've been waking her up on time every day… Huh? She sometimes prefer to stay in bed a bit longer?! Is that what she told you? What else did she say? …"},{"f":"sanhua","t":"jianxin","s":"","q":"Jianxin... her soul has a beautiful golden hue, and she is a person of respectable character."},{"f":"sanhua","t":"lingyang","s":"","q":"That young liondancer? His soul appears in a unique shape, similar to that of an animal... I'm a little ashamed to admit that I once mistook him for a beast from the wild... Ahem. …"},{"f":"sanhua","t":"baizhi","s":"","q":"Baizhi is a brilliant scholar. I once worked with her on a collaborative project, assigned by Madam Magistrate. …"},{"f":"taoqi","t":"jinhsi","s":"","q":"People think Lady Jinhsi is too young to lead, but I don't see the problem. Her young age may be seen as a disadvantage, but it's also her greatest strength. …"},{"f":"taoqi","t":"jiyan","s":"","q":"General Jiyan's schedule is always so impossibly tight... He seems to keep finding more issues to take care of, like a devoted parent who never allows himself any rest. …"},{"f":"taoqi","t":"sanhua","s":"","q":"Oh, I wish I had someone like Sanhua. Imagine how much easier my work would be with her help. Where on earth did Lady Jinhsi find herself such an incredible bodyguard? …"},{"f":"taoqi","t":"xiangli-yao","s":"","q":"Mr. Xiangli? Yes, he is a great collaborator of ours at the Ministry of Development. Our work partially overlaps with the Academy's research projects, and I consult him daily. …"},{"f":"baizhi","t":"yangyang","s":"","q":"Some people are good at listening, while some are good at counseling others. Yangyang is good at both. With her, you can just be yourself."},{"f":"baizhi","t":"chixia","s":"","q":"When I first met Chixia, I was indeed a bit overwhelmed... She was always vibrant and lively, and her way of thinking was very different from mine. …"},{"f":"baizhi","t":"mortefi","s":"","q":"We didn't converse frequently, but our cooperation was always seamless. …"},{"f":"baizhi","t":"xiangli-yao","s":"","q":"His good temper is almost as impressive as the exceptional talent he has. I've never seen him raise his voice in anger at anyone. No matter how impossible the task sounds, he always delivers."},{"f":"encore","t":"aalto","s":"","q":"Aalto's money this and money that all day, but did you know? Sometimes he helps people for free! He just wouldn't tell me why... Hmph. Then it's up to me to find out!"},{"f":"encore","t":"verina","s":"","q":"Verina's flowers are grown with love! Nothing like the ones they sell in the New Federation! …"},{"f":"encore","t":"jiyan","s":"","q":"Grown-ups like him have to wear a long face all the time, you know. See? Being a grown-up is really tough!"},{"f":"encore","t":"mortefi","s":"","q":"Friends in Jinzhou told me Mortefi makes lots of fun gadgets and gizmos! That's so cool! Hmm, should I ask him for a bouncy sheep next time…"},{"f":"danjin","t":"yangyang","s":"","q":"When I just met Yangyang, I had been curious how someone could always be such a sweetheart. Later, I finally learned how gentleness with boundary has a powerful strength of its own."},{"f":"danjin","t":"mortefi","s":"","q":"Mortefi may seem a bit intimidating, but he's actually quite nice. Once my blade got really worn out, and Mortefi repaired it for me. …"},{"f":"danjin","t":"chixia","s":"","q":"You can never go wrong by taking lost children to Chixia. While some kids may find me scary, they would never be scared of her."},{"f":"danjin","t":"yinlin","s":"","q":"The familiar sight of Yinlin's thunder always reassures me that the upcoming battle will be a breeze. …"},{"f":"aalto","t":"encore","s":"","q":"Sometimes not even I can figure out just where Encore's getting all that energy from. As soon as we arrive somewhere, she's off making friends and sharing stories with the local kids in no time. …"},{"f":"aalto","t":"jiyan","s":"","q":"Being the Jinzhou Garrison's General is no walk in the park. You gotta have that big-picture thinking, be on top of everything, and make decisions like they're nothing. …"},{"f":"aalto","t":"calcharo","s":"","q":"I always enjoy doing business with a Ghost Hound. They keep things clean, They're straightforward, and they don't goof around."},{"f":"aalto","t":"chixia","s":"","q":"Oh, Miss Chixia. Our first convo didn't go quite as planned. I was doing some business in Jinzhou at the time, then she tried to arrest me, probably thought I was some crook. …"},{"f":"jiyan","t":"mortefi","s":"","q":"Others often perceive Mortefi as arrogant and unapproachable, but, in fact, he is not that hard to talk to. …"},{"f":"jiyan","t":"jinhsi","s":"","q":"The \"battle\" Magistrate Jinhsi has been taking on may prove more complicated than our situation in the borderlands: stipulating rules, overseeing trade, ensuring the well-being of the people, and…"},{"f":"jiyan","t":"taoqi","s":"","q":"Taoqi... Though our views on loose management don't always align, I am able to focus on the front lines without any worries, thanks to her effective leadership in maintaining Jinzhou's fortifications."},{"f":"jiyan","t":"yangyang","s":"","q":"She can perceive minute changes in the surroundings from the Streams, but there is a limit to the amount of information a single person can take in. …"},{"f":"mortefi","t":"jiyan","s":"","q":"It was Jiyan who rescued me from the wilderness and referred me to the Academy, and I've been thankful for that... I have solved a lot of problems for him in return, of course. …"},{"f":"mortefi","t":"baizhi","s":"","q":"Baizhi and I are almost colleagues, though we don't work in the same department. I've only interacted with her briefly on a few occasions, but I had the chance to read some of her writings. …"},{"f":"mortefi","t":"xiangli-yao","s":"","q":"That Xiangli Yao... One day I'll outdo him, and create even better inventions!"},{"f":"mortefi","t":"yangyang","s":"","q":"That girl, I think the name is Yangyang. I hear her humming from time to time. Surprisingly, her melodies always bring my mind to peace."},{"f":"camellya","t":"shorekeeper","s":"","q":"She's always so serious, following every rule despite being our de facto leader now. Well, she's taken care of me before on many occasions, so I gotta show some respect... …"},{"f":"camellya","t":"encore","s":"","q":"Encore… Ah, that girl who loves stories! I hope she'll mature into a strong opponent one day, then we'll have so much fun together."},{"f":"camellya","t":"aalto","s":"","q":"Aalto's a master at mind games. It's hard to get under his skin! He's not strong enough to pique my interest though. That guy relies on trickery too much for my liking."},{"f":"camellya","t":"jinhsi","s":"","q":"The Loong Maiden of Jinzhou reminds me of the Shorekeeper, the way they're oh-so-devoted to their duties, all the self-sacrifice! I don't understand, why must they burden themselves so much?"},{"f":"calcharo","t":"aalto","s":"","q":"Need to reach Aalto? Here's his contact. Mention my name for a twenty percent discount."},{"f":"calcharo","t":"verina","s":"","q":"I met her once. A prodigy in the field of botany at such a young age... Impressive."},{"f":"calcharo","t":"jiyan","s":"","q":"He's a capable leader. He once recommended me an ancient tome on the art of war from Huanglong, one that I regret not acquiring sooner—it could have saved me some effort. As for the deal between us... …"},{"f":"calcharo","t":"mortefi","s":"","q":"Pretentious, arrogant, and self-absorbed... That man epitomizes every trait associated with those snooty New Federation nobles. That said, I cannot deny his talent in crafting Tacetite Weapons. …"},{"f":"yinlin","t":"chixia","s":"","q":"I guess you can say Chixia is a younger colleague of mine. She is a natural fit for the Patroller position. With time and experience, she will surely excel in her role."},{"f":"yinlin","t":"rover","s":"","q":"Being skilled as a Patroller doesn't necessarily make one suited for undercover work, but curiously enough I see potential in you. Have you considered applying to the Bureau? …"},{"f":"lingyang","t":"yuanwu","s":"","q":"Uncle Yuanwu keeps lots of street cats at his boxing gym. I often bring them fish I've caught as thank-yous for, let's say, helping me practice. I wonder if those cats are picking up on his moves? …"},{"f":"lingyang","t":"chixia","s":"","q":"Chixia? Aha, you mean my top rival! I won't let her outshine me again... And why is that, you ask? Well, we're battling to see who can help more people!"},{"f":"lingyang","t":"jiyan","s":"","q":"In Jinzhou, the liondance tradition started as a way to celebrate victories in battle. …"},{"f":"lingyang","t":"jianxin","s":"","q":"Liondance is a fusion of martial arts and dance. It originated from traditional boxing and martial arts in Huanglong, emphasizing swift footwork and powerful postures. …"},{"f":"yuanwu","t":"lingyang","s":"","q":"Lingyang often visits my gym to play with Mimi just outside the front doors, always carrying a couple of fresh tetras as treats. …"},{"f":"yuanwu","t":"jianxin","s":"","q":"I am more than happy to get an outstanding training partner like Jianxin by merely offering her a simple meal... …"},{"f":"yuanwu","t":"danjin","s":"","q":"I can sense a dangerous aura from Danjin's way of fighting... I'm worried that she may have far too much burden on her shoulders at such a young age."},{"f":"yuanwu","t":"chixia","s":"","q":"Every morning, when I opened the gym, Chixia was already patrolling the street with exuberant energy. *chuckle*... I must keep up with my exercises too. Can't be outdone by the younger generations."},{"f":"jianxin","t":"yuanwu","s":"","q":"Occasionally I'd leave my sect to go on what we call self-cultivating trips. During one of those trips, I visited Mr. Yuanwu's boxing gym and challenged him to fight, and I won. …"},{"f":"jianxin","t":"chixia","s":"","q":"Chixia always invites me to spar. She's really good with her guns, and I've learned so much from those fights. I admire her dedication and genuineness. …"},{"f":"jinhsi","t":"changli","s":"","q":"Over the years, my esteemed teacher Changli has taught me much… Yet her smiling eyes still hold mysteries that I cannot yet comprehend."},{"f":"jinhsi","t":"sanhua","s":"","q":"Amidst my busy days, meals can easily slip my mind. Before I knew it, it would be well past the time for another meal. …"},{"f":"jinhsi","t":"taoqi","s":"","q":"Taoqi is able to breeze through mountains of workload with ease, despite her frequent yawns. Her efficiency is truly remarkable."},{"f":"jinhsi","t":"jiyan","s":"","q":"\"Qingloong rise, monsters gone\"... Every child in Jinzhou knows this nursery rhyme by heart. My faith rests with Jiyan, for with his protection the Tacet Discords will never breach our borders."},{"f":"xiangli-yao","t":"mortefi","s":"","q":"Mortefi is an interesting person. He's devoted to his work with unwavering determination. It's that kind of intense drive that pushes scientists towards brilliant discoveries. …"},{"f":"xiangli-yao","t":"baizhi","s":"","q":"Baizhi is a great researcher. Our work doesn't often overlap, but I've read her reports and they're well-informed and persuasive. …"},{"f":"xiangli-yao","t":"jinhsi","s":"","q":"Magistrate Jinhsi has been paying close attention to the battles against Tacet Discords. She often visits the Academy to learn about our latest progress in weapons development. …"},{"f":"xiangli-yao","t":"jiyan","s":"","q":"The Midnight Rangers bring valuable insights on Tacet Discords from their years of combat experience. General Jiyan has shared his extensive knowledge and new ideas with us. …"},{"f":"changli","t":"jinhsi","s":"","q":"Jinhsi is a bright and diligent soul. With time, she will undoubtedly blossom into a capable Magistrate. She has always been dedicated to her work, perhaps too much so. …"},{"f":"changli","t":"jiyan","s":"","q":"Upon my initial arrival in Jinzhou, I was tasked with handling paperwork at the City Hall for a temporary period. …"},{"f":"changli","t":"sanhua","s":"","q":"Sanhua is always composed and silent. As a bodyguard, she remains vigilant and alert at all times. …"},{"f":"changli","t":"jianxin","s":"","q":"Although we followed different sects of Taoist teachings, I found commonalities with her. Her pure and open mind is quite rare nowadays. …"},{"f":"zhezhi","t":"jianxin","s":"","q":"Before I came to Jinzhou, I once met her training in the mountains. She had journeyed far and wide, sharing tales of the incredible places she'd been. …"},{"f":"zhezhi","t":"verina","s":"","q":"I often run into her when I'm out painting. I'm curious about the habits of plants, and she's really into what they mean in Huanglong culture. …"},{"f":"zhezhi","t":"youhu","s":"","q":"She's got a real knack for appraising antiques, and knows all about where the rare old paintings are kept. …"},{"f":"zhezhi","t":"chixia","s":"","q":"Oh! She once invited me to dinner, and I said yes. However, when I arrived at the restaurant, it turned out to be a large gathering with dozens of people…"},{"f":"lumi","t":"jianxin","s":"","q":"When I am out delivering packages, I can't always find a place to stay, so sometimes I rest outdoors. Once, I woke up to see Miss Jianxin napping on a boulder on the cliff edge! She seemed... …"},{"f":"lumi","t":"chixia","s":"","q":"Ma Xiao...oops, I mean Chixia, hehe! Ahem, Patroller Chixia's packages are mostly snacks and hero play merchs. She was so stoked last time she got one, she practically bounced out of the room!"},{"f":"lumi","t":"youhu","s":"","q":"Youhu's packages always come with insurance, full of pricey antiques. I don't know much about these stuff, but the way she handles them, you can tell they're her treasures."},{"f":"lumi","t":"baizhi","s":"","q":"Researcher Baizhi's packages weigh a ton! Mostly stacks of books, thick ones, and a bunch of other weird stuff. Said those are for research purposes..."},{"f":"youhu","t":"lingyang","s":"","q":"That liondancer... Lingyang, I think? He surely knows how to come up with those Lucky Greetings. They sound cool. Almost as cool as my poems, I'll give him that!"},{"f":"youhu","t":"mortefi","s":"","q":"Even though I haven't chatted with him much, I can tell that Mortefi dude is a man of culture. Fingers crossed he becomes my client one day!"},{"f":"youhu","t":"chixia","s":"","q":"A Jinzhou Patroller... Uhh, gotta stay away from her... Hey, I've done nothing bad! Just used a few... tricks, to get back what belongs to the right people. Surely that's not a crime... right?"},{"f":"youhu","t":"danjin","s":"","q":"We're about the same age, but Danjin's much taller than me... The jade she wears is so pretty! *sigh*... It's a shame I can't feel a single joyful frequency from it..."},{"f":"shorekeeper","t":"camellya","s":"","q":"Though her words may not always align with her actions, she remains fiercely loyal to her desires. …"},{"f":"shorekeeper","t":"aalto","s":"","q":"A mature organization requires a personable and skilled negotiator, adept at forging connections with all they encounter. In the case of the Black Shores, that person is Aalto. …"},{"f":"shorekeeper","t":"encore","s":"","q":"Encore sees the world as a canvas for her boundless imagination. A warrior, a knight, or a little adventurer... …"},{"f":"roccia","t":"brant","s":"","q":"Brant is the greatest captain in all of Solaris. At least, that's what he insists I say. But it's true, having him around really does bring out the best in us. …"},{"f":"roccia","t":"carlotta","s":"","q":"Leading a large family is like steering a massive ship. It requires immense effort to keep it on course. …"},{"f":"roccia","t":"phoebe","s":"","q":"She's from the Order of the Deep. I don't know her very well, but… she was the first Acolyte to touch the box without getting bitten by Pero."},{"f":"roccia","t":"zani","s":"","q":"Zani is the definition of a proper adult. Working with her is so easy, so comfortable, and I never have to worry about anything going wrong..."},{"f":"carlotta","t":"brant","s":"","q":"He's the captain leading his crew through tempestuous seas, and I often wonder whether his gaze from the deck reveals ambition, or selflessness and passion. …"},{"f":"carlotta","t":"roccia","s":"","q":"I've always been curious about something. Just how much can her box, Pero, actually hold? New designs, costumes, the fine wines the troupe keeps hidden, shimmering sea gems and shells... …"},{"f":"carlotta","t":"zani","s":"","q":"Zani is wary of unnecessary, inefficient tasks because she excels at completing her work with haste, precision, and quality. …"},{"f":"carlotta","t":"phoebe","s":"","q":"Phoebe is as pure and innocent as a budding lily. Her kindness and devotion are beyond question. Yet, without sufficient strength, such virtues might lead one into the trap of blind faith. …"},{"f":"brant","t":"roccia","s":"","q":"Don't be fooled by our First Mate's age—if you ever need performance advice, she's your go-to. Plus, she's also an excellent stage designer!"},{"f":"brant","t":"carlotta","s":"","q":"She's got her course set and sticks to it, no matter what. Living as a Montelli is no easy path, but she's determined to make her own way. …"},{"f":"brant","t":"zani","s":"","q":"Many wear masks to fit in, but not her. Whatever her past, whatever roles she's played, she's here now, true to herself."},{"f":"brant","t":"cartethyia","s":"","q":"Some call her a saint; others, a sinner. But who is she really? No one cares how she treats her friends or faces her foes. …"},{"f":"phoebe","t":"roccia","s":"","q":"Miss Roccia might appear ice cold, but at heart, I know she is a gentle and caring person. Her kindheartedness brings smiles to all those around her. And then there's her friend, Pero. …"},{"f":"phoebe","t":"cartethyia","s":"","q":"...I once dreamt of a black sea, with swells growing larger and more violent. Amidst the spray, the Blessed Maiden appeared—or at least I think it was her. …"},{"f":"phoebe","t":"zani","s":"","q":"Not everyone in Ragunna worships the Sentinel. Certain Acolytes of the Order believe a person's worth is solely measured by their piety... …"},{"f":"phoebe","t":"brant","s":"","q":"Mother once told me a story about an adventurer braving storms in search of freedom. …"},{"f":"cantarella","t":"cartethyia","s":"","q":"She accomplished the impossible, reclaiming her humanity from the cage of a Divinity's vessel. When the Carnevale petals fall upon Ragunna's streets again, the Holy Maiden will at last be herself."},{"f":"cantarella","t":"carlotta","s":"","q":"Even in shackles, she dances elegantly—a true Montelli, yet more than that. Where will her choices lead her family? How delightful to imagine how she might present herself when next we meet."},{"f":"cantarella","t":"roccia","s":"","q":"The little girl with a giant box who plays with fireworks? A fascinating child. I wonder if bringing her into this castle would liven it up a little. Oh relax, I'm only teasing."},{"f":"cantarella","t":"rover","s":"","q":"Hmm, what would be a fitting analogy... perhaps an immortal jellyfish? …"},{"f":"ciaccona","t":"cartethyia","s":"","q":"The Blessed Maiden? Or a villain? There are still many unanswered questions in Cartethyia's story. I would never sing an incomplete story. …"},{"f":"ciaccona","t":"carlotta","s":"","q":"She's a discerning buyer and a skilled seller. Whether modern or vintage, Carlotta always appraises art with a fair and thoughtful eye. …"},{"f":"ciaccona","t":"phoebe","s":"","q":"There was a time when I thought about telling her the truths about the Order, but after seeing her devotion as she stood in front of the Sentinel's statue, praying for the people of Ragunna, I…"},{"f":"ciaccona","t":"brant","s":"","q":"He's a captivating performer on stage. Sometimes I wonder about Brant's fate. Will he be written into the pages of history after countless adventures? …"},{"f":"zani","t":"carlotta","s":"","q":"Lady Carlotta? Her vision has never been limited to Ragunna, or even Rinascita. Hers was about the world beyond the sea horizon. …"},{"f":"zani","t":"phoebe","s":"","q":"To me, Ragunna's fate lies in the will of its people, not the Sentinel. Many Acolytes would call this heresy, but not Phoebe. That's what makes her unique. …"},{"f":"zani","t":"brant","s":"","q":"Brant is a skilled actor, a respected captain, and a fighter willing to sacrifice everything for truth and justice. But what I envy most is that he's never weighed down by stacks of paperwork. …"},{"f":"zani","t":"cantarella","s":"","q":"The Fisalia family has always clung to Ragunna's traditions, stubbornly resisting change. But Signorina Cantarella, the current head, isn't as traditional as people imagine. …"},{"f":"lupa","t":"cartethyia","s":"","q":"In that empty city, Cartethyia was there for me during my most delirious and painful moments. At first, our conversations were a bit stiff. Guess she hadn't spoken to anyone in who knows how long. …"},{"f":"lupa","t":"augusta","s":"","q":"Whenever I watch videos of the Ephor's past fights, I do wonder if she stepped into the arena for political reasons, or-or to prove herself. …"},{"f":"lupa","t":"iuno","s":"","q":"A spirited, nimble girl... That's my impression of her. Once, I saw her sprint along the narrow bricks at the top of the high wall and leap onto a statue like a cat. …"},{"f":"lupa","t":"brant","s":"","q":"Many Gladiators of the Blue Furies come from the Troupe of Fools. I remember once, at Cliffside Harbor, I saw their captain leap off the deck just to hug his crew. …"},{"f":"phrolova","t":"cartethyia","s":"","q":"Not human, yet possessing a will whole as any mortal's. A creation molded by Divinity... how I envy her. …"},{"f":"cartethyia","t":"cantarella","s":"","q":"I… took away the brilliant future she was meant to have. The future of being the Sentinel's true Blessed Maiden. All the goodwill and hopes placed upon me, and the power I now possess…"},{"f":"cartethyia","t":"phoebe","s":"","q":"That girl has a kind and gentle heart. Duties aside, she always does her best to be there for others. Honestly, when it comes to knowledge of the Order's doctrines, I'm nowhere near as good as Phoebe. …"},{"f":"cartethyia","t":"ciaccona","s":"","q":"When I was a child, I used to beg the bards passing through town to sing me stories of knights. …"},{"f":"cartethyia","t":"lupa","s":"","q":"The nature of the Threnodian's power to converge often makes me appear dangerous and unsettling after battle, but Lupa has never once recoiled. …"},{"f":"augusta","t":"lupa","s":"","q":"A genius made for the arena whose passion burns pure. Had we met in the early days of the Colosseum, perhaps we would have fought side by side, as you two do now. …"},{"f":"augusta","t":"iuno","s":"","q":"Iuno and I became friends because we're so alike—stubborn, headstrong, and relentless in the face of defeat. …"},{"f":"augusta","t":"buling","s":"","q":"Buling... Heh, just from the name alone, I can tell she's from Huanglong. From the moment we met, this remarkable young lady made an impression. …"},{"f":"iuno","t":"augusta","s":"","q":"Here's a little secret even Augusta doesn't know. When we first met, I told her she'd lead Septimont into a new era, and she believed it to be one of my prophecies. But really, it was just a hunch. …"},{"f":"iuno","t":"lupa","s":"","q":"Anyone who's seen her matches probably feels the urge to challenge her as well, wouldn't you agree? Her passion for competition is really something... Pure, simple, and completely genuine. …"},{"f":"iuno","t":"carlotta","s":"","q":"She and her family always manage to bring something fresh to Septimont and Ragunna, even to themselves. And before you know it, those little novelties spark whole new trend.... Me? …"},{"f":"buling","t":"jianxin","s":"","q":"She's the same as me, super good at some stuff, bad at others. Last martial contest, Master Shiling said she punches too much, thinks too little. …"},{"f":"buling","t":"youhu","s":"","q":"Master Youhu helps lots of my clients check their treasures, telling them what's real, what's fake, clearing their doubts and worries. But she's never that serious with me. …"},{"f":"buling","t":"aalto","s":"","q":"We haven't met many times, but somehow, he feels like an old friend. Why? I thought I knew many people from traveling, but he knows even more! No matter where I go, someone always drops his name. …"},{"f":"buling","t":"camellya","s":"","q":"She's... an interesting one. Before I joined the Black Shores, she tried to fight me. Of course I was no match for her, so I ran for it, as fast as oil on shoes! But she chased me all the way... …"},{"f":"galbrena","t":"augusta","s":"","q":"Augusta... she was my childhood friend. Back then, I'd usually sit quietly under a tree, lost in my own thoughts. She'd be off swinging her sword, shouting about becoming the next Hero of Heroes. …"},{"f":"galbrena","t":"cartethyia","s":"","q":"It was through the Dark Tide's memory that I first learned of her. I never saw her as anyone's Resonator, and in return, she gave me a reply that was... wild, reckless, but resolute. …"},{"f":"galbrena","t":"aalto","s":"","q":"The Black Shores' database needs constant updates, and I send captured Tacet Discord data back like clockwork. …"},{"f":"galbrena","t":"calcharo","s":"","q":"While hunting in the New Federation, we had our eyes on the same Tacet Discord. His goal was to eliminate it. Mine was to absorb it. …"},{"f":"chisa","t":"buling","s":"","q":"She's a very fascinating Taoist. If I remember correctly, she's from Mengzhou, in Huanglong? She's always saying odd metaphors and local sayings, and showing off the rare antiques she carries around. …"},{"f":"chisa","t":"shorekeeper","s":"","q":"Shorekeeper helped me a lot while I've been recovering at the Black Shores. It took me a while to settle in, but in time, I started to feel the kindness there. …"},{"f":"qiuyuan","t":"sanhua","s":"","q":"My master once told me some of my ancestors moved from Chongzhou to the borderlands. Sanhua comes from that branch of lineage. Like me, her only interest used to be swordplay. …"},{"f":"qiuyuan","t":"changli","s":"","q":"In Mingting, people like me rarely got the chance to meet the high-ups—and understandably so. We only show up where there's trouble. …"},{"f":"qiuyuan","t":"jiyan","s":"","q":"Across the troops under Huanglong's Ministry of War, you'd find no one other than him competent enough to earn the title of General at such a young age. …"},{"f":"lynae","t":"mornye","s":"","q":"What do Professor Mornye and I have in common? Easy. We both hate sitting through class! So I took her for a drive one time. Total stone face the whole time, but I could tell she was loving it. …"},{"f":"lynae","t":"sigrika","s":"","q":"When I first got here, Sigrika helped me get a handle on student life... She's super serious, the kind who never lets up on herself, you know? …"},{"f":"lynae","t":"luuk-herssen","s":"","q":"The first time I met Dr. Herssen at the infirmary, I got this weird feeling he could see right through me. Now I think I might've just imagined it. …"},{"f":"lynae","t":"chisa","s":"","q":"First time I saw Chisa, I thought that quiet, intense vibe meant \"keep your distance.\" Man, was I wrong. We clicked instantly. …"},{"f":"mornye","t":"lynae","s":"","q":"I wish to be like her, having the freedom to do what she wants. To act without constraint. Especially the constraint of a class schedule. …"},{"f":"mornye","t":"denia","s":"","q":"You'll see her at every public lecture, nodding along as if she understands every word. Until she inevitably dozes off, jolts awake after bumping her head on the seat, and then drifts off again... …"},{"f":"mornye","t":"sigrika","s":"","q":"She's a remarkably conscientious student, but her persistence can sometimes be wasteful. For instance, she will fill the exam questions with unrelated formulas when she doesn't know the answers. …"},{"f":"mornye","t":"luuk-herssen","s":"","q":"When I was a student, I frequented the infirmary. Dr. Herssen had me take a medicine imported from the New Federation that would only take effect if I went to bed before 10 P.M. …"},{"f":"luuk-herssen","t":"lucilla","s":"","q":"The President of the Academy and a... savvy adult. Lucilla knows what she wants, and what others want from her. …"},{"f":"luuk-herssen","t":"aemeath","s":"","q":"That child who means so much to you... I do see you in her. So bullheaded up against fate itself. So decisive and brave it leaves one speechless. …"},{"f":"luuk-herssen","t":"sigrika","s":"","q":"Sigrika... She shoulders a weight far too heavy for someone her age. Thankfully, there's candy to sweeten the gloom. She never hesitates to sample my newest candies. Her fearlessness has me impressed. …"},{"f":"aemeath","t":"luuk-herssen","s":"","q":"Dr. Luuk is kind and competent, admired by many students. But he wasn't always this way. He used to carry a constant tension, as if bracing for battle at any moment. …"},{"f":"aemeath","t":"mornye","s":"","q":"The first time I met Professor Mornye was when you took me to the Academy, right before you left Lahai-Roi. …"},{"f":"aemeath","t":"shorekeeper","s":"","q":"On nights filled with your sighs, I used to sneak near your desk, catching snippets of your conversations with her. Shorekeeper… yes, that's her name. …"},{"f":"aemeath","t":"camellya","s":"","q":"I used to chase Exoswarm across the frostlands with Camellya! She's really good at gaming, too. Ha, I wish we could gather for a rematch someday. …"},{"f":"sigrika","t":"denia","s":"","q":"Nia always says, \"If you can't finish it, just drop it. Toss away whatever's hard or sad. Running away makes everything so much easier.\" …"},{"f":"sigrika","t":"lynae","s":"","q":"Lynae always comes and goes like the wind. Wherever she passes, she leaves behind these dazzling colors. Those colors are her riddles, and the smile on her face? That's always the answer."},{"f":"sigrika","t":"luuk-herssen","s":"","q":"After the New Solar Celebration incident, some students said we should make a banner for Dr. Luuk. …"},{"f":"sigrika","t":"lucilla","s":"","q":"President Lucilla's classes are so much fun. When she taught the history of Royan clothing, she even turned it into an impromptu styling workshop! But getting into her classes is almost impossible. …"},{"f":"denia","t":"sigrika","s":"","q":"I find myself wondering... how nice would it be if Sigrika were just an ordinary girl? Without all that weight on her shoulders. …"},{"f":"denia","t":"hiyuki","s":"","q":"That miko from Ashinohara is so powerful. Like she's cheating, you know? Yeah, I'd heard the stories before. But facing that power myself was a whole different story. …"},{"f":"denia","t":"mornye","s":"","q":"Professor Mornye fits every idea I've ever had of a perfect teacher: She has a soft voice, a sweet heart, she knows her stuff inside and out, and her classes are seriously intense. And the best part? …"},{"f":"denia","t":"phrolova","s":"","q":"She was one of the few Overseers in the Fractsidus who would talk to me. When I was floating in the Voidmatter pod, she'd even play the violin for me. I really enjoyed her music. It's just... …"},{"f":"rebecca","t":"lucy","s":"","q":"Lucy... Dunno where to even start. Known her a while now, but can't say I really get her, y'know? Far as her netrunnin' skills go, she's a freakin' code wizard, can't deny that. I guess... …"},{"f":"rebecca","t":"lynae","s":"","q":"Lynae and I just click. Got a lot in common—graffiti, motorbikes, badass vibes... Even went racin'. I ate her dust, but whatevs. Not many students 'round here are as nova as she is. …"},{"f":"rebecca","t":"mornye","s":"","q":"Mornye's chrome legs and what I've got installed are toootally different. Hers are see-through! Can look right through 'em 'thout seein' a single wire or chip! Like, how's that even work? …"},{"f":"rebecca","t":"luuk-herssen","s":"","q":"At first, he gave me creepy scavenger vibes. Boy, was I wrong. Hear he's good at patchin' peeps up, even their minds. Might let him scan my skull sponge when the dust settles. …"},{"f":"lucilla","t":"hiyuki","s":"","q":"You, me, and Hiyuki. If I may, I'd like to presume we're \"cut from the same cloth.\" Each of us had our reasons for starting down the path we're on now. …"},{"f":"lucilla","t":"luuk-herssen","s":"","q":"He's got just a few too many mysteries for a doctor... But as a colleague, his skills speak for themselves. And that's what I trust."},{"f":"lucilla","t":"sigrika","s":"","q":"She's just the cutest, isn't she? Pure, honest, trying so hard to carry the weight of the world on those tiny shoulders. Breaks my heart. …"},{"f":"lucilla","t":"aemeath","s":"","q":"Behind that lovely smile is pure steel. I feel inspired just hearing her voice—Heh, see? You're a better teacher than I am!"},{"f":"lucy","t":"rebecca","s":"","q":"She always saw me as a choom, as part of the crew. But in all our time together, I never once opened up to her. It wasn't until she was gone that I realized... just how much I left unsaid."},{"f":"lucy","t":"mornye","s":"","q":"\"Tragedy did not extinguish her ideals. She works tirelessly to reach the stars with her own two hands.\" I mean, sh*t, you can feel the weight of these records just by reading them. …"},{"f":"lucy","t":"lynae","s":"","q":"When my Resonance Ability awakened, I hacked Lynae. Not on purpose, but I did see the memories she'd locked away. Hard to reconcile the weight of her past with that big, bright smile. …"},{"f":"lucy","t":"lucilla","s":"","q":"We've never crossed paths, but her rep's solid. Hear she did a lot of heavy lifting with the Somnoire situation. The approachable Madam President, former editor for the Pioneer Association... …"},{"f":"hiyuki","t":"denia","s":"","q":"I... believe I failed her, in a way. Had I been quicker to see through the Fractsidus's plot, she might not have suffered as she did. I borrowed your strength when I delivered that strike. …"},{"f":"hiyuki","t":"lucilla","s":"","q":"Though Lucilla insists our partnership is only contractual, I am well aware that without her discreet arrangements, I would have no place in the Spacetrek Collective, much less have obtained that…"},{"f":"hiyuki","t":"lynae","s":"","q":"She is a bright spirit. I am aware of certain secrets she carries. In a sense, we are both bound by our pasts. …"},{"f":"hiyuki","t":"chisa","s":"","q":"Chisa is also from Ashinohara. I have made a point to avoid meeting her. After all, in our homeland, Mikos only appeared in the darkest of times. …"},{"f":"yangyang-xuanling","t":"suisui","s":"","q":"My sister... she's always been a pillar of confidence and reliability. I grew up following in her footsteps, convinced there was nothing in this world she couldn't handle. …"},{"f":"yangyang-xuanling","t":"jinhsi","s":"","q":"Magistrate Jinhsi... she carries herself with such poise that it masks her age. …"},{"f":"yangyang-xuanling","t":"cartethyia","s":"","q":"The Blessed Maiden of Rinascita, a wandering knight... I can picture her drifting across the land of Rinascita like untethered winds from here on. You see a resemblance between us? …"},{"f":"suisui","t":"hsin","s":"","q":"Unlike the other Sentinels of Huanglong, Hsin doesn't feel like a divinity looking down from on high. Somehow, I see a part of her that's unmistakably \"human.\" …"},{"f":"suisui","t":"jingran","s":"","q":"The Cat of the Nether Lamp… the rumors make him sound like a ghost story. A figure in black, drifting through shadows with a Nether Lamp and the chill of the netherworld clinging to him. …"},{"f":"suisui","t":"yangyang","s":"","q":"Since we were children, people have said that Yangyang and I share only a face, that our spirits couldn't be more different. …"},{"f":"suisui","t":"qingxiao","s":"","q":"One of my merchant caravans once spoke of a Transcendent who killed the Tacet Discords blocking their path through Xuanfang. That was Paragon Qingxiao. …"},{"f":"qingxiao","t":"hsin","s":"","q":"Hsin is one to follow Her whims, and carries a wealth of emotions unlike any other Sentinel of Huanglong. It was She who first invited me to hold the honorary title of Xuan Paragon in Xuanfang Hold. …"},{"f":"qingxiao","t":"jingran","s":"","q":"Years ago, his master crossed paths with me and casually asked for a divination before venturing into a Mirage Realm. I know only a little of the art, but I obliged regardless... It was an ill omen. …"},{"f":"qingxiao","t":"changli","s":"","q":"The flame she manipulates is indeed a rare and perilous force. My Quietude Art could only ease the burning pain it caused her. …"},{"f":"qingxiao","t":"yangyang","s":"","q":"When I first met her, I thought the Xuanling Bird had returned. She sees right through the ways of the world and hears the unspoken voices of others. …"},{"f":"hsin","t":"suoming","s":"","q":"When I was wholly consumed by remolding the Civilization Capsule and building Xuanfang Hold, Mengzhou weathered its trials alone. …"},{"f":"hsin","t":"qingxiao","s":"","q":"The Xuan Paragon appears cold and distant, but she is softer than she lets on. If you need something from her, all it takes is a little persistence, and she will fold. \"I will not go,\" …"},{"f":"hsin","t":"suisui","s":"","q":"Now there is a remarkably clever young woman. I have seen so many lose their way in the world of commerce, but she navigates it with purpose, her heart set on something larger than profit, pursuing…"},{"f":"jingran","t":"suisui","s":"","q":"The famous Madam Chongming Pruner... efficient, sharp-minded, and knows her way around all sorts. The Zhaoming Commerce Guild keeps growing with her at the helm. …"},{"f":"jingran","t":"qingxiao","s":"","q":"There's an old story. A girl went looking for a Transcendent in the mountains, panicked when she ran into Tacet Discords, and fell off a cliff. At the last second, she was saved by a flying sword. …"},{"f":"jingran","t":"qiuyuan","s":"","q":"Our masters were old acquaintances. When I was a kid, the old man couldn't stop talking about him, \"He's young, but his blade is already incredibly fast.\" …"},{"f":"suoming","t":"hsin","s":"","q":"If we speak of age, Hsin is actually a bit younger than me. Having assisted the Sentinel for so long, watching Her grow into who She is today naturally carries a certain fondness. …"},{"f":"lily","t":"lucilla","s":"","q":"During my short stay at Startorch Academy, Miss Lucilla was ever so kind to me. It wasn't until later that I learned she was from the New Federation. When I told her my story, she didn't speak a word. …"},{"f":"lily","t":"sigrika","s":"","q":"Before I returned to the New Federation, I spent some time at Startorch Academy. That's where I met Sigrika. We became fast friends. She has a rare gift for knowing when not to pry. …"}],"bonds":{"rover|yangyang":"She found Rover on the day they woke, and has been their guide to Jinzhou ever since.","jinhsi|rover":"The Magistrate invited Rover to Jinzhou with a trail of tokens. Their trust was tested on Mt. Firmament and held.","rover|shorekeeper":"She took her form because of Rover and waited ages to see them again. Rover would not let her burn out for the plan.","camellya|rover":"She calls Rover her seed. Whatever the two of them were to each other in a past life, she remembers all of it.","cartethyia|rover":"Rover freed her from the role she was made for. She gave Rover the Aero attribute and her trust.","phrolova|rover":"Enemies by allegiance. Inside her Lost Beyond, Rover saw why she plays for the dead.","aemeath|rover":"Rover searched the frostlands for the Exostrider and found the person who used to fly it.","changli|rover":"She tested Rover from behind the scenes before deciding they could be trusted with Jinhsi's plan.","chixia|yangyang":"Friends who found Rover together. One is all calm, the other all noise.","changli|jinhsi":"Teacher and student, now Magistrate and Counselor. Changli has shaped Jinhsi's path since she was a child.","jinhsi|sanhua":"Sanhua guards the Magistrate, and the Magistrate is the reason Sanhua has a place to belong.","jiyan|mortefi":"The General fights with what the researcher builds. They respect each other more than either says.","xiangli-yao|zhezhi":"An artist and a scientist who arrived together at the Moon-Chasing Festival, each making things to help people.","aalto|encore":"Black Shores partners. He handles the information, and she keeps him honest.","camellya|shorekeeper":"Both of the Black Shores, both bound to Rover, and in complete disagreement about what that means.","carlotta|zani":"Both serve the Montelli family. Carlotta gives the orders that ruin Zani's evenings.","brant|roccia":"Captain and comedian of the Troupe of Fools. He gave her a stage and a crew.","cartethyia|phoebe":"The acolyte who believed in the Order and the Maiden the Order betrayed.","augusta|iuno":"Sun and moon of Septimont. They rule the same city by very different lights.","augusta|lupa":"The Ephor and her finest gladiator.","chisa|hiyuki":"Both come from Ashinohara and ended up far from it in Lahai-Roi.","lynae|mornye":"Student and professor, and the first two people Rover relies on at Startorch.","aemeath|mornye":"Mornye builds toward the stars that Aemeath once flew for.","lucilla|luuk-herssen":"President and physician of Startorch Academy, who have kept its secrets and its students together.","denia|sigrika":"Classmates. One tries harder than anyone, the other pretends not to try at all.","lucy|rebecca":"Crewmates from Night City who arrived in Solaris together.","suisui|yangyang-xuanling":"Both daughters of noted Mingting families, working the Xuanfang crisis from different ends.","hsin|qingxiao":"The sword that guards Xuanfang and the Sentinel who has been missing from it.","hsin|suoming":"The Sentinel and the mortal who ruled on her behalf while she was gone.","jingran|suisui":"A merchant who plans everything and a Nethermancer who follows no plan.","changli|qiuyuan":"Both came out of Mingting's politics, and know what it costs to serve there.","buling|shorekeeper":"The Black Shores' most relaxed consultant and its most serious keeper."},"elements":["Glacio","Fusion","Electro","Aero","Spectro","Havoc"],"regions":["Huanglong","Black Shores","Rinascita","Lahai-Roi","New Federation","Fractsidus","Crossover","Unknown"],"labels":{"extra":"","title":"Resonance power","faction":"Affiliation","region":"Sphere","weapon":"Weapon","el":"Attribute"}};
